OL,3,CNottinghamshire bike firm Raleigh set
OL,4,Cfor administration
OL,6,FHistoric Nottinghamshire firm Raleigh
OL,7,Fis set to enter administration after
OL,8,Fthe Dutch company that owns the iconic
OL,9,Fbrand announced it could not solve its
OL,10,Ffinancial problems.
OL,12,FThe well-known bike manufacturer,
OL,13,Fwhich was once the world's largest and
OL,14,Fhelped define the 1970s with its
OL,15,Ficonic Chopper models, will likely be
OL,16,Fplaced into administration after its
OL,17,Fparent company announced it could no
OL,18,Flonger meet its financial obligations.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
