PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786006084
OL,3,CNottinghamshire bike firm Raleigh set
OL,4,Cfor administration
OL,6,FEstablished in 1887 in Nottingham,
OL,7,FRaleigh was purchased by Netherlands-
OL,8,Fbased Accell Group for around E60
OL,9,Fmillion in 2012. It was renamed Accell
OL,10,FUK & Ireland Ltd last year.
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, August 5, Accell - which
OL,13,Fis one of Europe's largest bike
OL,14,Fsellers - said that despite extensive
OL,15,Fefforts to restructure it had not
OL,16,Ffound a viable way to continue
OL,17,Foperations and that "initiating local
OL,18,Finsolvency proceedings of the relevant
OL,19,Fgroup subsidiaries is the necessary
OL,20,Fnext step".
OL,26,@pD@_Ok
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/8
