CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786006084
OL,3,CNottinghamshire bike firm Raleigh set
OL,4,Cfor administration
OL,6,FA Notice of Intention (NOI) to appoint
OL,7,Fan administrator was filed for
OL,8,FEastwood-based Accell UK & Ireland Ltd
OL,9,F(formerly Raleigh) on the same day.
OL,11,FAn NOI is a document filed at court,
OL,12,Fstating a company's intention to
OL,13,Fappoint administrators in an attempt
OL,14,Fto save the business from liquidation.
OL,16,FThe measure helps businesses by
OL,17,Ftemporarily halting existing or
OL,18,Fpending creditor action, giving the
OL,19,Fbusiness 10 days of protection so it
OL,20,Fcan look at rescue options.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786006084
OL,3,CNottinghamshire bike firm Raleigh set
OL,4,Cfor administration
OL,6,FJonas Nilsson, CEO of Accell Group,
OL,7,Fsaid: "This is a deeply sad and
OL,8,Ffrustrating situation given all the
OL,9,Fhard work and everything we have
OL,10,Fachieved, with the support of
OL,11,Fshareholders and lenders, to
OL,12,Frestructure Accell's operations and
OL,13,Ffinances.
OL,15,F"It is an especially difficult moment
OL,16,Ffor our employees, creditors,
OL,17,Fcustomers, suppliers, and partners.
OL,26,@oD@GOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786006084
OL,3,CNottinghamshire bike firm Raleigh set
OL,4,Cfor administration
OL,6,F"Every realistic option for the future
OL,7,Fof the business has been tirelessly
OL,8,Fexplored,and none have resulted in a
OL,9,Fsolution to continue the group in its
OL,10,Fcurrent form.
OL,12,F"Our immediate focus is to support an
OL,13,Forderly process, provide clarity
OL,14,Fwherever possible, and work with the
OL,15,Frelevant court-appointed
OL,16,Fadministrators to preserve viable
OL,17,Factivities and employment where
OL,18,Fcircumstances allow."
OL,26,@zD@UO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/8
