OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786006084
OL,3,CNottinghamshire bike firm Raleigh set
OL,4,Cfor administration
OL,6,FThe group added it would share more
OL,7,Finformation once it becomes available.
OL,8,FAccell has been approached for comment
OL,9,Fon what the move will mean for its
OL,10,FNottinghamshire employees and the
OL,11,FRaleigh brand.
OL,13,FWhile Raleigh was once an industrial
OL,14,Fbehemoth, recent redundancies and its
OL,15,Fparent firm's restructurings have
OL,16,Ftaken a toll.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
