FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786006084
OL,3,CNottinghamshire bike firm Raleigh set
OL,4,Cfor administration
OL,6,FAccell UK & Ireland recorded a loss
OL,7,Fbefore tax of more than #30 million in
OL,8,Fits most recent financial accounts -
OL,9,Fwhich cover 2023 - and at that time
OL,10,Fthe company employed an average of 130
OL,11,Fpeople.
OL,13,FAt its peak in the 1970s, Raleigh
OL,14,Femployed 13,000-plus people
OL,15,Fnationwide, including about 8,000
OL,16,Fstaff based on numerous sites in
OL,17,FTriumph Road.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
